# Short 7, "The Drums page" (vertical, tools/film.py --layout vertical): Pressure playing (the kick and the bass
# forward, the heaviest ducking), SEQ for the Drums page; Hits down to the kick alone and back up, Swing to a
# lilt, Duck off and back harder (slow turns, single steps); ALGORITHM through two kits, Punch and Dusty; then SEQ
# again for the Drum sound page: the kick tuned down, longer, punchier. Every move from a bar's downbeat.
# Each `bar` prints the film's time there (the cue sheet for the labels).
turn PRESET 6 5
wait 30
expect piece 6
bar 8
wav 16-short-drums.wav
film 16-short-drums.film
bar 8 PRESSURE playing (E Phrygian, 128)
bar 10 SEQ: the Drums page
tap SEQ
bar 11 KNOB 2, Hits 65 down to 0: the kick alone
turn K2 -65 45
expect par7 0
bar 14 Hits 0 up to 70: the hats back
turn K2 70 45
expect par7 70
bar 16 KNOB 3, Swing 51% up to 63%
turn K3 60 45
expect par26 65
bar 18 KNOB 4, Duck 70 down to 0: no pump
turn K4 -70 45
expect par30 0
bar 20 Duck 0 up to 80: it pumps
turn K4 80 45
expect par30 80
bar 22 ALGORITHM: the kit Punch
turn ALGO 1 300
expect par35 2
bar 24 Dusty
turn ALGO 2 150
expect par35 4
bar 26 SEQ again: the Drum sound page; KNOB 1, Kick tune 5 down
tap SEQ
wait 300
turn K1 -5 200
expect par48 -5
bar 28 KNOB 2, Kick len longer
turn K2 30 50
expect par49 30
bar 30 KNOB 3, Punch harder
turn K3 30 50
expect par50 30
bar 34 END
filmstop
wavstop
